    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51674" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθάπαξ</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰπ]</span>, Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>once for all</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				21.349
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.231
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				3
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.70c
			</span></i>; <i>out-and-out, absolutely</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κ. ἐχθροί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.197
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἄτιμ ος γέγονεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					21.87
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				25.30
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. σπουδαῖος</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατά τι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.6
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Archig.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.626
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ κ. μὴ συναπ τόμενοι</span>
			not <i>at all</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ocell.
				4.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὕτω κ. πέπρακεν ἑαυτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.118
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ κ</span>. not even
			<i>once</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.2.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.20.12
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲ τὸ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.97
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντως δ᾽, οὐ κ</span>. not
			merely <i>in a single case</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1055.22
			</span></i>; <i>singly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.90.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
